              "text": "Several exam facts follow directly from these definitions. Because the mandate is *free*, an Abgeordnete who switches Fraktion keeps their seat — but if enough members defect, the government can lose its majority. By long-standing convention the **President of the Bundestag** comes from the strongest Fraktion; since March 2025 that is Julia Klöckner (CDU). And the longest-serving member (*Alterspräsident*) may open the very first sitting — a favourite distractor."
