              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "And learning does not stop at a certificate. Because what jobs demand changes quickly, adults are expected to keep learning after their training — *lifelong learning* (**Weiterbildung**). The main public provider is the **Volkshochschule (VHS)**, offering affordable courses — languages, integration and citizenship courses, IT, health and more — open to adults of every age and background (the same VHS system that runs the Einbürgerungstest you are preparing for)."
